 "limitations": [
  "The simulation's generative model is Gaussian with a linear mirror; real currencies may be mirrors through a nonlinear monotone map, which leaves the ANALYTIC arm (rho_M == -rho_A exactly) untouched but changes the induced coefficient at intermediate lam.",
  "The within-cell mirror strength of the real A/dM pair is not recoverable from the stored jsons (per-seed values live in the npz), so the measured pair is placed on the grid through the INDUCED across-cell coefficient.",
  "N_PERM_SIM = 2000 (vs L214's 20000): p resolution 1/2001, adequate at alpha .05 and registered in advance with its cost reason.",
  "beta is calibrated against an OBSERVED value (L214's mean_absrhoA), so it is a nuisance parameter and description; the branch rides on curve SHAPE.",
  "SGN's success criterion requires BOTH currencies' binomial tests to be significant in opposite directions, which is a strict reading; a looser one would only move the crossing further toward low |r|."
 ],
